                this.Manager.Comment(@"This step would have covered ""[MS-SMB2] 3.3.5.2.9 Verifying the Session"", ""[MS-SMB2] If Connection.Dialect belongs to the SMB 3.x dialect family, and Session.EncryptData is TRUE, the server MUST do the following: 
